sive system of early intervention for infants/toddlers with disabilities and their families."},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"Child Development Services (CDS)\"","why":"Taken from the parent page, /cds."}],"mechanical":["bare email linked: 1","empty paragraphs removed: 1","drupal entity attrs stripped: 50","elements that are not HTML: 2","action links marked: 14"],"findings":[],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/cds/icc","title":"The Maine Interagency Coordinating Council (ICC)","changed":"2026-04-06T23:21:46+00:00","words":134,"bytes":5779,"fixes":["bare email linked: 1","empty paragraphs removed: 1","drupal entity attrs stripped: 50","elements that are not HTML: 2","action links marked: 14"],"flags":["no section-header device"],"contentSafe":true,"headings":[],"outline":[],"components":{"cards":0,"cardHeaders":0,"cardTitles":0,"accordions":0,"tables":0,"dataTables":0,"contactCube":0,"jumbotron":0,"dcNote":0,"blockheads":0,"videos":0,"images":0,"buttons":0},"access":{"imagesNoAlt":0,"vagueLinkText":[],"emptyLinks":0,"tablesNoScope":0,"multipleH1":0,"inlineColour":0},"links":{"internal":[],"files":["/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Development%20Services%20-%20Notes%20-%206.24.24.pdf","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ICC%20Meeting%20Notes%204-1-24.pdf","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ICC%20Meeting%20Notes%201-22-24.pdf","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ICC%20Meeting%20Notes%2009-11-23.docx","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ICC%20Meeting%20Notes%2006-12-23.docx","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ICC%20Meeting%20Notes%2003-13-23.docx","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ICC%20Meeting%20Agenda%2012.12.22.docx","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ICC%20Meeting%20Notes%206.27.22.docx","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ICC%20Meeting%20Notes%203.14.22.docx","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ICC%20Meeting%20Notes%2012.13.21.docx","/doe/sites/main